  "description": ".NET binding for Google's LiteRT-LM on-device LLM inference (P/Invoke over the C API). Add a LiteRtLmSharp.runtime.<rid> package for native binaries. Unofficial community bindings, not affiliated with or endorsed by Google. LiteRT is a trademark of Google LLC.",
